WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.288
Install Python: Install Python from python.org slash downloads. On Windows, tick Add Python to PATH before you install. On Mac or Linux, use the installer or python 3.

2
00:00:12.638 --> 00:00:22.862
Verify it worked: Verify it worked. Open a terminal and run python dash dash version, or python 3 dash dash version. You should see a version number.

3
00:00:23.212 --> 00:00:32.164
Install a code editor: Install a code editor such as Cursor or Visual Studio Code. Add the Python extension, then open your python-beginner-workbook folder.

4
00:00:32.514 --> 00:00:42.282
Your first script: Create hello.py with a print hello message, then run python hello.py. Change the text — that is your first real program.

5
00:00:42.632 --> 00:00:52.856
Python tips: If Windows cannot find Python, reinstall and tick Add to PATH. Use the editor terminal, finish Module 1 exercises, then take the quiz.
